     "XASSigma_method2.dat" u 1:13 title 'Im[{/Symbol s}_{yz}]' with lines ls 2
plot "XASSigma_method2.dat" u 1:14 title 'Re[{/Symbol s}_{zx}]' with lines ls 1,\
